14→ * Governed by: {@code .decisions/transport-abstraction-design/adr.md}
15→ *
16→ * @param nodeId unique identifier for the node; must not be null or empty
17→ * @param host   the hostname or IP address; must not be null or empty
18→ * @param port   the port number; must be in range [1, 65535]
19→ */
20→public record NodeAddress(String nodeId, String host, int port) {
21→
22→    public NodeAddress {
